@host = http://localhost:5078

### Create a todo
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Write the README" }

### Validation failure (empty title) -> 400
POST {{host}}/todos
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "" }

### List todos
GET {{host}}/todos

### Get one todo (paste an id from the create response)
GET {{host}}/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Complete a todo
POST {{host}}/todos/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/complete
